.TH strlist_dump_named 3
.SH NAME
strlist_dump_named \- debug dump of a string list with labels
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strlist.h"
.PP
.BI "void strlist_dump_named(buffer *" out ", const strlist *" sl ", const char *" names "[]);"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strlist_dump_named
writes a structured dump of the string list
.I sl
to
.I out
using the labels provided in the
.I names
array for each element.